	spec: '/status usage bars in web and terminal use the same 14-character row that fills left to right: full blocks (█), then at most one partial left block (▏▎▍▌▋▊▉), then blank cells. Zero usage is blank; positive usage rounds up to an eighth of a cell so low usage stays visible; percentages clamp to 0..100. This replaces the earlier bottom-filled blocks (▁..█ repeated), which showed usage by height, and task ab shaded unused cells. Numeric percentages, reset labels, tables and all other behavior remain unchanged.',
